### 5. Preserved Game Bugs & Engine Specifics

1. **Array sizing**: `this.dest` is allocated with length 10 (`new boolean[10]`), but `reset()` and `alldest()` only loop over indices `0..4`. Preserved verbatim.
2. **`dtrakers` character constants**: `char c = '\u03e8'` (1000) and `'\u0fa0'` (4000) used as distance thresholds. Preserved verbatim.
3. **`denter` phase 4 ground calculation**: `this.m.ground = 950 - this.m.y;` (recalculated on credits transition). Preserved verbatim.

